This service is derived from the Postiz application and adapts behavior from
Postiz Agent. Both pinned upstream revisions and their source locations are
recorded in BIZZBLOX_UPSTREAM.md. Upstream LICENSE, CCLA.md, ICLA.md, copyright
notices, and Git history are preserved.

The combined work is distributed under GNU Affero General Public License v3.0.
The complete corresponding source for a deployed BizzBLOX revision must remain
available from https://github.com/Jam7-UK/bizzblox-social and the matching
corresponding-source workflow artifact.

Jam 7 modifications include:
- a side-effect-free typed Postiz Agent client;
- exact-tenant IAM/claim/credential admission;
- managed provider consent and opaque account/channel references;
- live provider contracts and idempotent publication/readback/cancellation;
- a deny-by-default white-label service route profile;
- private AWS S3/KMS media storage and production container targets; and
- BizzBLOX operational, source-publication, and security checks.

